= Kabul

The withdrawal from Afghanistan collapses into a frantic evacuation. A suicide bombing kills thirteen service members. The pictures are devastating. The policy had wide public support. The execution did not.

- @defend: Defend the decision to leave.
- @accountability: Acknowledge failures and review.

@defend
subtitle: Principle over image.
on-arrival: pop_mod -= 0.3; mod_dissent += 2; unity += 1

The argument is right on the substance and weak on the politics.

@accountability
subtitle: Honest, costly.
on-arrival: media_trust += 2; pop_mod -= 0.2; stability += 1

The after-action review is long. The damage is done.
